    "detailed_description": "<h1>Author's other games</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>When shooting, you should calibrate the shooting distance and pay attention to the weak points.<br>In case of armor that cannot be penetrated by armour piercing projectile, high explosive projectile can be tried.<br>When being hit, you should set a certain angle to improve the equivalent armor.<br>When encountering the shell which cannot be defended by armor, you can look for shelter.<br>Try to challenge the single enemy and evacuate when besieged.<br>Get on your tank and join the fight!",
